From 83e5ea897be4d3ea3db757c16be82e12c461f02b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:50:31 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 21/29] inkling2: Mini's loop kernels, the projection groups
 and the batched draft walk under the kernel contract

Gates 1-4 with float64 references and a planted control each: tf_ink2_loop_msg
(both outputs), down8/16/64, blend, mix, norm and bank against interval
references at the served shapes (decode rows to 2,048-row prompt passes);
tf_exl3_group5_* and tf_exl3_rot_group5 as replacements of each member's
linear_body and rot_in (contract_exl3's case, with the family's launch);
tf_ink2_dsp_vocab_rows and tf_ink2_dsp_pick_rows beside their one-row
kernels' tests. The family exports proj_group for the tests; no served code
changes.
---
